{"c":[{"name":"20261004T233521Z-ca79b84757c7cc74","text":"D2-02: HelperOptions.routing absent keeps producers self-triggering (tests, producer evals); main.ts routes when Jev is on. Routed producers hold offers (engine.release/dropHeld, openApp.showHeld, events.judge); await routing.idle() then routedSettled.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261004T235441Z-17480ff5b594d902","text":"B27: B17/B18 memory held-out sets label the user's own First/Last name fields 'none' (written when fill copied values only whole); score them with the relabelled copies in ~/.caret-run/evidence/screen/b27/memsets, whose about-fill-eval accepts expect first/last.","type":"note"}]}
